{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapViewDelegate.h#L880","fileName":"MLNMapViewDelegate.h"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"title":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","role":"symbol","externalID":"c:objc(pl)MLNMapViewDelegate(im)mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:"},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:annotationcanshowcallout:"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@BOOL","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"BOOL"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MLNMapView"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"mapView","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"annotationCanShowCallout:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"id<MLNAnnotation>","preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNAnnotation","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"annotation","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"mapView","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The map view that has selected the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"name":"annotation","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The object representing the annotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A Boolean value indicating whether the annotation should show a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"callout.","type":"text"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This method is called after an annotation is selected, before any callout is","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displayed for the annotation."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the return value is "},{"code":"YES","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", a callout view is shown when the user taps on an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotation, selecting it. The default callout displays the annotation’s title"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and subtitle. You can add accessory views to either end of the callout by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementing the "},{"code":"-mapView:leftCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" methods. You can further"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"customize the callout’s contents by implementing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the return value is "},{"code":"NO","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or if this method is absent from the delegate, or"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if the annotation lacks a title, the annotation will not show a callout even"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when selected."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Related examples","anchor":"Related-examples","level":4},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Add annotation views and images"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Display custom views as callouts"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TODO: Default callout usage, learn how to show callouts for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation"},{"type":"text","text":" objects."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a Boolean value indicating whether the annotation is able to display"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extra information in a callout bubble."}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapview","title":"MLNMapView","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNMapView"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"An interactive, customizable map view with an interface similar to the one","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided by Apple’s MapKit."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate":{"title":"MLNMapViewDelegate","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMapViewDelegate","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"},{"text":" protocol defines a set of optional methods that you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"can use to receive map-related update messages. Because many map operations"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"require the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" class to load data asynchronously, the map view calls"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these methods to notify your application when specific operations complete. The"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"map view also uses these methods to request information about annotations","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"displayed on the map, such as the styles and interaction modes to apply to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"individual annotations."}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNAnnotation":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" protocol is used to provide annotation-related information"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to a map view. To use this protocol, you adopt it in any custom objects that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"store or represent annotation data. Each object then serves as the source of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"information about a single map annotation and provides critical information,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"such as the annotation’s location on the map. Annotation objects do not provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the visual representation of the annotation but typically coordinate (in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"conjunction with the map view’s delegate) the creation of an appropriate"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"objects to handle the display."}],"title":"MLNAnnotation","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNAnnotation","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnannotation","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNAnnotation"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","title":"MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"role":"collection"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a Boolean value indicating whether the annotation is able to display"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extra information in a callout bubble."}],"title":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:annotationcanshowcallout:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:annotationCanShowCallout:"}],"role":"symbol"}}}